ss=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Finlay</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lighthouse\" title=\"Lighthouse\">Lighthouse</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">$14,999</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Function\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Function</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Allows the player to anchor any loose item on their base.</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.0.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">January 14th, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The Magic Anchor wand, as its name suggests, is a \"wand\" that can anchor loose items to your property. The item appears as a black wand model with white rings at the bottom and top. \n</p><p>The description of the item is, \"Anchoring loose items?! It quite literally is like magic! Disclaimer. Do not use on people.\" \n</p><p>While mostly useless after the addition of the Anchor tool in build mode, it does still have a couple of niche uses (such as anchoring trees cut with the Living Axe before they fall over).\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>This item changes its spot on where to buy it every now and then. It has no shelf to sit on.</li>\n<li>The idea for this item was brought in a conversation about preventing griefing of bases. First idea for it was a hammer that you \"hammer\" items into place to make them immovable.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903163411\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.031 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.041 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 64/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 72/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.005/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019490/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   37.096      1 Template:Objects\n100.00%   37.096      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:282-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903163411 and revision id 20394. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Tools"],"links":[{"title":"Lighthouse","exists":true}],"images":["Magic_wand_ub.png","Magic_wand.png"]}
